{"seq":1,"slug":"unit-testing","title":"单元测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/unit-testing","wordCount":588,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"单元测试\">单元测试</h1><p>单元测试是 Android 测试金字塔的基础，运行在 JVM 上，速度快、反馈及时。现代 Android 单元测试使用 JUnit 5 作为测试框架，MockK 作为 Kotlin 友好的 Mock 库，Turbine 测试 Flow，配合协程测试工具验证异步逻辑。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>单元测试围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>测试框架 JUnit 5</strong>：提供 <code>@Nested</code>、<code>@ParameterizedTest</code> 等现代特性，用于组织与参数化用例。</li>\n<li><strong>Mock 与隔离</strong>：MockK 以 Kotlin 原生 DSL 定义返回值（<code>every</code> / <code>coEvery</code>）并验证调用（<code>verify</code> / <code>coVerify</code>），<code>relaxed = true</code> 免去逐个 stub。</li>\n<li><strong>Flow 测试 Turbine</strong>：通过 <code>test { }</code> 块按序 <code>awaitItem</code> 验证发射序列，<code>cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents</code> 收尾。</li>\n<li><strong>协程与调度器控制</strong>：<code>MainDispatcherRule</code> 替换 <code>Dispatchers.Main</code>，<code>runTest</code> + <code>advanceUntilIdle</code> 让 ViewModel 逻辑可在 JVM 上完整验证。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"junit-5\">JUnit 5</h2><p>JUnit 5 是 Java/Kotlin 生态的标准测试框架，提供灵活的注解、参数化测试和扩展机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ArticleValidatorTest {&#10;&#10;    private lateinit var validator: ArticleValidator&#10;&#10;    @BeforeEach&#10;    fun setup() {&#10;        validator = ArticleValidator()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `valid article passes validation`() {&#10;        val article = Article(id = &quot;1&quot;, title = &quot;标题&quot;, content = &quot;内容...&quot;)&#10;        val result = validator.validate(article)&#10;        assertTrue(result.isValid)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `empty title fails validation`() {&#10;        val article = Article(id = &quot;1&quot;, title = &quot;&quot;, content = &quot;内容...&quot;)&#10;        val result = validator.validate(article)&#10;        assertFalse(result.isValid)&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;标题不能为空&quot;, result.errors.first())&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @ParameterizedTest&#10;    @ValueSource(strings = [&quot;&quot;, &quot; &quot;, &quot;  &quot;])&#10;    fun `blank titles fail validation`(title: String) {&#10;        val article = Article(id = &quot;1&quot;, title = title, content = &quot;内容&quot;)&#10;        assertFalse(validator.validate(article).isValid)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Nested&#10;    inner class ContentValidation {&#10;        @Test&#10;        fun `content exceeding max length fails`() {&#10;            val longContent = &quot;a&quot;.repeat(10001)&#10;            val article = Article(id = &quot;1&quot;, title = &quot;标题&quot;, content = longContent)&#10;            assertFalse(validator.validate(article).isValid)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleValidatorTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private lateinit var validator: ArticleValidator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @BeforeEach</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        validator = ArticleValidator()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `valid article passes validation`() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val article = Article(id = \"1\", title = \"标题\", content = \"内容...\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val result = validator.validate(article)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertTrue(result.isValid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `empty title fails validation`() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val article = Article(id = \"1\", title = \"\", content = \"内容...\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val result = validator.validate(article)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertFalse(result.isValid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"标题不能为空\", result.errors.first())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ParameterizedTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ValueSource(strings = [\"\", \" \", \"  \"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `blank titles fail validation`(title: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val article = Article(id = \"1\", title = title, content = \"内容\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertFalse(validator.validate(article).isValid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Nested</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    inner class ContentValidation {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fun `content exceeding max length fails`() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val longContent = \"a\".repeat(10001)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val article = Article(id = \"1\", title = \"标题\", content = longContent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertFalse(validator.validate(article).isValid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>JUnit 5 常用注解：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注解</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@Test</code></td>\n<td>标记测试方法</td>\n<td>基本测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@BeforeEach</code> / <code>@AfterEach</code></td>\n<td>每个测试前后</td>\n<td>初始化/清理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@BeforeAll</code> / <code>@AfterAll</code></td>\n<td>所有测试前后</td>\n<td>共享资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Nested</code></td>\n<td>嵌套测试类</td>\n<td>逻辑分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@ParameterizedTest</code></td>\n<td>参数化测试</td>\n<td>多数据集验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@DisplayName</code></td>\n<td>自定义名称</td>\n<td>可读性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"mockk\">MockK</h2><p>MockK 是 Kotlin 原生的 Mock 框架，支持协程、扩展函数和 DSL 语法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ArticleRepositoryTest {&#10;&#10;    private val api: ArticleApi = mockk()&#10;    private val dao: ArticleDao = mockk(relaxed = true)&#10;    private val repository = ArticleRepository(api, dao)&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `getArticles returns remote data and caches locally`() = runTest {&#10;        val remoteArticles = listOf(&#10;            ArticleDto(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;远程文章一&quot;, &quot;内容一&quot;),&#10;            ArticleDto(&quot;2&quot;, &quot;远程文章二&quot;, &quot;内容二&quot;)&#10;        )&#10;        coEvery { api.getArticles() } returns ApiResponse(200, &quot;ok&quot;, remoteArticles)&#10;&#10;        val result = repository.getArticles()&#10;&#10;        assertEquals(2, result.size)&#10;        coVerify { dao.insertArticles(any()) }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `getArticles falls back to local data on network error`() = runTest {&#10;        val localArticles = listOf(&#10;            ArticleEntity(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;本地文章&quot;, &quot;内容&quot;, &quot;a1&quot;, 0L)&#10;        )&#10;        coEvery { api.getArticles() } throws IOException(&quot;网络错误&quot;)&#10;        every { dao.getAllArticles() } returns flowOf(localArticles)&#10;&#10;        val result = repository.getArticles()&#10;&#10;        assertEquals(1, result.size)&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;本地文章&quot;, result[0].title)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `deleteArticle calls API and DAO`() = runTest {&#10;        coEvery { api.deleteArticle(&quot;1&quot;) } returns ApiResponse(200, &quot;ok&quot;, Unit)&#10;&#10;        repository.deleteArticle(&quot;1&quot;)&#10;&#10;        coVerifyOrder {&#10;            api.deleteArticle(&quot;1&quot;)&#10;            dao.deleteArticle(any())&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleRepositoryTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val api: ArticleApi = mockk()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val dao: ArticleDao = mockk(relaxed = true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository = ArticleRepository(api, dao)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `getArticles returns remote data and caches locally`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val remoteArticles = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ArticleDto(\"1\", \"远程文章一\", \"内容一\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ArticleDto(\"2\", \"远程文章二\", \"内容二\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coEvery { api.getArticles() } returns ApiResponse(200, \"ok\", remoteArticles)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val result = repository.getArticles()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(2, result.size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coVerify { dao.insertArticles(any()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `getArticles falls back to local data on network error`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val localArticles = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ArticleEntity(\"1\", \"本地文章\", \"内容\", \"a1\", 0L)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coEvery { api.getArticles() } throws IOException(\"网络错误\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        every { dao.getAllArticles() } returns flowOf(localArticles)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val result = repository.getArticles()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(1, result.size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"本地文章\", result[0].title)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `deleteArticle calls API and DAO`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coEvery { api.deleteArticle(\"1\") } returns ApiResponse(200, \"ok\", Unit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repository.deleteArticle(\"1\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coVerifyOrder {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            api.deleteArticle(\"1\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dao.deleteArticle(any())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MockK 常用函数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>mockk()</code></td>\n<td>创建 Mock 对象</td>\n<td><code>mockk&lt;ArticleApi&gt;()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>every</code></td>\n<td>定义普通函数返回值</td>\n<td><code>every { dao.getAll() } returns flow</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>coEvery</code></td>\n<td>定义挂起函数返回值</td>\n<td><code>coEvery { api.get() } returns data</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>verify</code></td>\n<td>验证普通函数调用</td>\n<td><code>verify { dao.insert(any()) }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>coVerify</code></td>\n<td>验证挂起函数调用</td>\n<td><code>coVerify { api.delete(&quot;1&quot;) }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>relaxed = true</code></td>\n<td>返回默认值</td>\n<td>避免手动 stub 所有方法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"turbine-flow-测试\">Turbine（Flow 测试）</h2><p>Turbine 是 Square 出品的 Flow 测试库，提供简洁的 API 验证 Flow 发射序列。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class SearchViewModelTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()&#10;&#10;    private val repository = FakeSearchRepository()&#10;    private lateinit var viewModel: SearchViewModel&#10;&#10;    @BeforeEach&#10;    fun setup() {&#10;        viewModel = SearchViewModel(SavedStateHandle(), repository)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `search emits loading then results`() = runTest {&#10;        repository.setResults(listOf(SearchItem(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;Kotlin&quot;)))&#10;&#10;        viewModel.uiState.test {&#10;            assertEquals(SearchUiState(), awaitItem())&#10;&#10;            viewModel.search(&quot;Kotlin&quot;)&#10;&#10;            val loading = awaitItem()&#10;            assertTrue(loading.isLoading)&#10;&#10;            val success = awaitItem()&#10;            assertFalse(success.isLoading)&#10;            assertEquals(1, success.results.size)&#10;&#10;            cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `events flow emits snackbar on error`() = runTest {&#10;        repository.setShouldFail(true)&#10;&#10;        viewModel.events.test {&#10;            viewModel.search(&quot;error&quot;)&#10;&#10;            val event = awaitItem()&#10;            assertIs&lt;UiEvent.ShowSnackbar&gt;(event)&#10;            assertTrue(event.message.contains(&quot;失败&quot;))&#10;&#10;            cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class SearchViewModelTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository = FakeSearchRepository()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private lateinit var viewModel: SearchViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @BeforeEach</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel = SearchViewModel(SavedStateHandle(), repository)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `search emits loading then results`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repository.setResults(listOf(SearchItem(\"1\", \"Kotlin\")))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.uiState.test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertEquals(SearchUiState(), awaitItem())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            viewModel.search(\"Kotlin\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val loading = awaitItem()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertTrue(loading.isLoading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val success = awaitItem()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertFalse(success.isLoading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertEquals(1, success.results.size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `events flow emits snackbar on error`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repository.setShouldFail(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.events.test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            viewModel.search(\"error\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val event = awaitItem()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertIs&#x3C;UiEvent.ShowSnackbar>(event)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertTrue(event.message.contains(\"失败\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Flow.test] --&gt; B[awaitItem - 等待下一个发射]&#10;    A --&gt; C[awaitError - 等待错误]&#10;    A --&gt; D[awaitComplete - 等待完成]&#10;    A --&gt; E[expectNoEvents - 验证无发射]&#10;    A --&gt; F[cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents]&#10;&#10;    classDef turbineStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class B,C,D,E,F turbineStyle\">graph TD\n    A[Flow.test] --&gt; B[awaitItem - 等待下一个发射]\n    A --&gt; C[awaitError - 等待错误]\n    A --&gt; D[awaitComplete - 等待完成]\n    A --&gt; E[expectNoEvents - 验证无发射]\n    A --&gt; F[cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents]\n\n    classDef turbineStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class B,C,D,E,F turbineStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"协程测试\">协程测试</h2><p><code>kotlinx-coroutines-test</code> 提供控制协程执行的工具。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MainDispatcherRule(&#10;    private val dispatcher: TestDispatcher = UnconfinedTestDispatcher()&#10;) : TestWatcher() {&#10;    override fun starting(description: Description) {&#10;        Dispatchers.setMain(dispatcher)&#10;    }&#10;    override fun finished(description: Description) {&#10;        Dispatchers.resetMain()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class DataSyncServiceTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `sync completes all tasks in order`() = runTest {&#10;        val service = DataSyncService(&#10;            testScheduler = StandardTestDispatcher(testScheduler)&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        service.startSync()&#10;        advanceUntilIdle()&#10;&#10;        assertTrue(service.isSyncComplete)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `timeout cancels long-running operation`() = runTest {&#10;        val service = SlowService()&#10;&#10;        val result = withTimeoutOrNull(1000) {&#10;            service.longOperation()&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        assertNull(result)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MainDispatcherRule(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val dispatcher: TestDispatcher = UnconfinedTestDispatcher()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : TestWatcher() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun starting(description: Description) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Dispatchers.setMain(dispatcher)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun finished(description: Description) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Dispatchers.resetMain()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class DataSyncServiceTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `sync completes all tasks in order`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val service = DataSyncService(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            testScheduler = StandardTestDispatcher(testScheduler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        service.startSync()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        advanceUntilIdle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertTrue(service.isSyncComplete)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `timeout cancels long-running operation`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val service = SlowService()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val result = withTimeoutOrNull(1000) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            service.longOperation()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertNull(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>runTest</code></td>\n<td>启动测试协程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>advanceUntilIdle()</code></td>\n<td>执行所有挂起的协程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>advanceTimeBy(ms)</code></td>\n<td>推进虚拟时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UnconfinedTestDispatcher</code></td>\n<td>立即执行（不排队）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>StandardTestDispatcher</code></td>\n<td>按调度执行（可控）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"viewmodel-测试\">ViewModel 测试</h2><p>结合上述工具对 ViewModel 进行完整测试。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ArticleListViewModelTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()&#10;&#10;    private val repository = FakeArticleRepository()&#10;    private lateinit var viewModel: ArticleListViewModel&#10;&#10;    @BeforeEach&#10;    fun setup() {&#10;        viewModel = ArticleListViewModel(repository)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `initial state is loading`() = runTest {&#10;        viewModel.uiState.test {&#10;            val initial = awaitItem()&#10;            assertTrue(initial.isLoading)&#10;            cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `refresh updates articles`() = runTest {&#10;        repository.setArticles(listOf(Article(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;文章一&quot;, &quot;内容&quot;)))&#10;&#10;        viewModel.uiState.test {&#10;            skipItems(1)&#10;&#10;            val loaded = awaitItem()&#10;            assertEquals(1, loaded.articles.size)&#10;&#10;            repository.setArticles(listOf(&#10;                Article(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;文章一&quot;, &quot;内容&quot;),&#10;                Article(&quot;2&quot;, &quot;文章二&quot;, &quot;内容&quot;)&#10;            ))&#10;            viewModel.refresh()&#10;&#10;            val refreshing = awaitItem()&#10;            assertTrue(refreshing.isRefreshing)&#10;&#10;            val refreshed = awaitItem()&#10;            assertEquals(2, refreshed.articles.size)&#10;&#10;            cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleListViewModelTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository = FakeArticleRepository()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private lateinit var viewModel: ArticleListViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @BeforeEach</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel = ArticleListViewModel(repository)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `initial state is loading`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.uiState.test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val initial = awaitItem()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertTrue(initial.isLoading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `refresh updates articles`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repository.setArticles(listOf(Article(\"1\", \"文章一\", \"内容\")))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.uiState.test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            skipItems(1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val loaded = awaitItem()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertEquals(1, loaded.articles.size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repository.setArticles(listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Article(\"1\", \"文章一\", \"内容\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Article(\"2\", \"文章二\", \"内容\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            viewModel.refresh()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val refreshing = awaitItem()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertTrue(refreshing.isRefreshing)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val refreshed = awaitItem()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assertEquals(2, refreshed.articles.size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>UnconfinedTestDispatcher</code> 可以让协程立即执行，适合大多数 ViewModel 测试；当需要精确控制执行顺序时使用 <code>StandardTestDispatcher</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>JUnit 5 提供 <code>@Nested</code>、参数化测试等现代测试特性</li>\n<li>MockK 是 Kotlin 原生 Mock 框架，支持协程、DSL 语法和验证调用顺序</li>\n<li>Turbine 简化 Flow 测试，通过 <code>test {}</code> 块按序验证发射值</li>\n<li><code>MainDispatcherRule</code> 替换 <code>Dispatchers.Main</code>，使 ViewModel 可在 JVM 上测试</li>\n<li>ViewModel 测试结合 Fake Repository + Turbine + 协程测试工具实现完整验证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"单元测试","id":"单元测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"JUnit 5","id":"junit-5"},{"level":2,"text":"MockK","id":"mockk"},{"level":2,"text":"Turbine（Flow 测试）","id":"turbine-flow-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"协程测试","id":"协程测试"},{"level":2,"text":"ViewModel 测试","id":"viewmodel-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Play Store 发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/play-store-release"},"next":{"title":"Compose UI 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/ui-testing-compose"}}